            },
            "text": "Not specified in the paper.",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "f29b2f7e-95fe-424b-972b-a85b0e760c4f",
                "document_uuid": "6279d15c-67df-4505-965f-c4237dbb5dfc",
                "chunk_index": 7,
                "authority": "Synthetic_Data",
                "document_title": "1a",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "- **Business impact metrics**: Fraud detection is evaluated using precision, recall, false-positive rates, and financial loss prevention.\n- **Real-time scoring**: Immediate intervention to block fraudulent transactions.\n- **Risk-based decisioning**: Allowing low-risk transactions while flagging high-risk cases.",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "9c861658-9e7d-40d8-91fc-8434a20bab28",
                "document_uuid": "6279d15c-67df-4505-965f-c4237dbb5dfc",
                "chunk_index": 8,
                "authority": "Synthetic_Data",
                "document_title": "1a",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "False-positive rates are a critical metric for evaluation. Human oversight is required to review edge cases and validate model outputs, reducing false positives/negatives.",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "48070fa1-0cd8-4793-9734-85be4735543d",
                "document_uuid": "6279d15c-67df-4505-965f-c4237dbb5dfc",
                "chunk_index": 9,
                "authority": "Synthetic_Data",
                "document_title": "1a",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "- **Real-time scoring**: Blocking fraudulent transactions pre-loss.\n- **Risk-based decisioning**: Balancing customer experience with security.\n- **Feedback loops**: Retraining models using confirmed fraud cases, disputes, and analyst reviews.\n- **Regulatory compliance**: Ensuring model explainability, data privacy, and human oversight.",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
